  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Model for Initiatives through Local Empowerment (SMILE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Grant will be utilized to build a prototype for a viallage where all community members ensure protection of children from all forms of violence including Child Sexual Abuse to serve as a model for scaling up. The project will be implemented in 4 villages, one in each of the 4 districts of Abbottabad, Lahore, Sukkur and Jaffarabad of Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
